<mjml lang="en-AU">
  <mj-head>
    <mj-title>Owner accepted – HV-TEST, 824 High Street Road, Glen Waverley</mj-title>
    <mj-preview>Helen has paid for the electrical safety check. Nothing for you to do until it clears.</mj-preview>
    <mj-include path="./partials/head.mjml" />
  </mj-head>
  <mj-body>
    <mj-wrapper css-class="card">
      <mj-include path="./partials/header.mjml" />
      <mj-section>
        <mj-column>
          <mj-text mj-class="hi">Good news, Sam.</mj-text>
          <mj-text mj-class="h1" css-class="email-heading" padding="4px 12px 10px">Helen accepted!</mj-text>
          <mj-text>Helen Yang has accepted the quote for 824 High Street Road, Glen Waverley (HV-TEST) and has paid for the electrical safety check.</mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>
      <mj-section>
        <mj-column mj-class="panel-card">
          <mj-text mj-class="h2" padding="18px 18px 10px">What happens next</mj-text>
          <mj-table padding="0 18px 6px">
            <tr><td width="32" valign="top" style="padding:2px 0 14px;"><span class="num">1</span></td><td style="padding:0 0 14px;"><strong>Electrical safety check</strong><br /><span class="muted">The licensed electrician offers Helen times. Nothing for you to do.</span></td></tr>
            <tr><td width="32" valign="top" style="padding:2px 0 14px;"><span class="num">2</span></td><td style="padding:0 0 14px;"><strong>Offer Helen 3 install days</strong><br /><span class="muted">Once the safety check clears, your portal asks you to offer Helen 3 install days. Helen picks one and it's booked, or suggests other days, until you agree.</span></td></tr>
            <tr><td width="32" valign="top" style="padding:2px 0 12px;"><span class="num">3</span></td><td style="padding:0 0 12px;"><strong>Install within 30 days of the safety check</strong><br /><span class="muted">Your portal shows how many days are left.</span></td></tr>
          </mj-table>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>
      <mj-section>
        <mj-column>
          <mj-text padding="8px 0 0"></mj-text>
          <mj-button href="https://estimate.homeinsulationvictoria.com.au/field/TEST-JOB">Open the job</mj-button>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-include path="./partials/footer-trade.mjml" />
    </mj-wrapper>
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
